      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Unit testing - testing units of functionality in isolation from it's dependencies*.\n\nTest-Driven Development: writing those tests *first* in order to write code that is\nverified as you create it (writing code that is testable).\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Unit testing - testing units of functionality in isolation from it's dependencies*.\n\nTest-Driven Development: writing those tests *first* in order to write code that is\nverified as you create it (writing code that is testable).\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
